            "Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google\u2019s terms do not allow keeping them).": [
                "Ayarlay\u0131n. Google de\u011ferlendirmeleri, bir De\u011ferlendirmeler bloku i\u00e7eren sayfa her g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fclendi\u011finde canl\u0131 olarak y\u00fcklenir: g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleme ba\u015f\u0131na kendi anahtar\u0131n\u0131z \u00fczerinden bir Place Details iste\u011fi yap\u0131l\u0131r, asla saklanmaz (Google ko\u015fullar\u0131 bunlar\u0131n tutulmas\u0131na izin vermez)."
