            ],
            "Saved. Trustpilot reviews are fetched in the background within a minute or two; Google reviews load live on the page.": [
                "Kaydedildi. Trustpilot incelemeleri bir veya iki dakika i\u00e7inde arka planda al\u0131n\u0131r; Google incelemeleri sayfada canl\u0131 olarak y\u00fcklenir."
            ],
            "Trustpilot reviews are fetched once a day in the background and kept on your site, so a busy page costs nothing extra on your Trustpilot account; if a refresh fails, the last reviews stay. Google does not allow its reviews to be stored, so they are loaded live when a visitor views the page: each view is one request on your own Google key, billed by Google.": [
                "Trustpilot incelemeleri arka planda g\u00fcnde bir kez al\u0131n\u0131r ve sitenizde tutulur, bu nedenle yo\u011fun bir sayfa Trustpilot hesab\u0131n\u0131zda fazladan bir \u00fccrete yol a\u00e7maz; yenileme ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z olursa son incelemeler kal\u0131r. Google, incelemelerinin saklanmas\u0131na izin vermez, bu nedenle bir ziyaret\u00e7i sayfay\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcledi\u011finde canl\u0131 olarak y\u00fcklenirler: her g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcleme, Google taraf\u0131ndan faturaland\u0131r\u0131lan kendi Google anahtar\u0131n\u0131zda bir istek anlam\u0131na gelir."
            ],
